GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2028(b)(2)(C)(iii) the Secretary may refer the matter to the Attorney General` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the Secretary has made a finding of substantial failure under clause (i)` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Upon a finding under subparagraph (C)(i) of a substantial failure"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

@ref s 2028(b)(2)(C)(iii) injunctive relief shall issue (src:2775)
GIVEN `the Attorney General has sued in an appropriate district court` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a showing is made that noncompliance has occurred` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2028(b)(2)(C)(iii) appropriate injunctive relief shall issue` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the Attorney General has sued in an appropriate district court` AND `a showing is made that noncompliance has occurred` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "upon suit by the Attorney General in an appropriate district court of the United States and a showing that noncompliance has occurred"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

§ `s 2028(c) Review; technical assistance`

-- src:2777 | (1) The Secretary shall provide for the review of the programs for the provision of the assistance described in subsection (a)(2)(A) for which payments are made under this chapter.
@ref s 2028(c)(1) review of the programs (src:2777)
GIVEN `payments are made under this chapter for the program` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2028(c)(1) the Secretary shall provide for the review of the program` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `payments are made under this chapter for the program` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "for which payments are made under this chapter"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- src:2778 | (2) The Secretary is authorized as the Secretary deems practicable to provide technical assistance with respect to the programs for the provision of the assistance described in subsection (a)(2)(A).
@ref s 2028(c)(2) technical assistance (src:2778)
GIVEN `the Secretary deems it practicable` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2028(c)(2) the Secretary may provide technical assistance` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the Secretary deems it practicable`
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE
    -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "as the Secretary deems practicable"
    OTHERWISE NOTHING

§ `s 2028(d) Penalty for violations`

-- src:2780 | Whoever knowingly and willfully embezzles, misapplies, steals, or obtains by fraud, false statement, or forgery, any funds, assets, or property provided or financed under this section shall be fined not more than $10,000 or imprisoned for not more than five years, or both, but if the value of the funds, assets or property involved is not over $200, the penalty shall be a fine of not more than $1,000 or imprisonment for not more than one year, or both.
@ref s 2028(d) penalty for violations (src:2780)
GIVEN conduct IS A `s 2028(d) conduct`
      `knowingly and willfully` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the funds, assets or property were provided or financed under this section` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2028(d) the conduct is within the offence` MEANS
    BRANCH
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Whoever knowingly and willfully"
        IF (NOT `knowingly and willfully`) THEN NOTHING
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "any funds, assets, or property provided or financed under this section"
        IF (NOT `the funds, assets or property were provided or financed under this section`) THEN NOTHING
        -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): the text names "embezzles, misapplies, steals, or obtains by fraud, false statement, or forgery" and does not close the list with "only"
        IF conduct EQUALS `s 2028(d) any other conduct` THEN NOTHING
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

@ref s 2028(d) fined not more than $10,000 or $1,000 (src:2780)
GIVEN `value of the funds, assets or property in dollars` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 2028(d) the most the person may be fined, in dollars` MEANS
    BRANCH
        -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the text speaks of a value "not over $200" and says nothing of a value below zero
        IF `value of the funds, assets or property in dollars` LESS THAN 0 THEN NOTHING
        IF `value of the funds, assets or property in dollars` AT MOST 200 THEN JUST 1_000
        OTHERWISE JUST 10_000

@ref s 2028(d) imprisoned for not more than five years or one year (src:2780)
GIVEN `value of the funds, assets or property in dollars` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 2028(d) the longest term of imprisonment, in years` MEANS
    BRANCH
        -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the text speaks of a value "not over $200" and says nothing of a value below zero
        IF `value of the funds, assets or property in dollars` LESS THAN 0 THEN NOTHING
        IF `value of the funds, assets or property in dollars` AT MOST 200 THEN JUST 1
        OTHERWISE JUST 5

§ `s 2028(e) Cash nutrition assistance benefits provided in Puerto Rico`

-- src:2782 | (1) Review
-- src:2783 | The Secretary, in consultation with the Secretary of Health and Human Services, shall carry out a review of the provision of nutrition assistance in Puerto Rico in the form of cash benefits under this section that shall include—
-- src:2784 | (A) an examination of the history of and purpose for distribution of a portion of monthly benefits in the form of cash;
-- src:2785 | (B) an examination of current barriers to the redemption of non-cash benefits by current program participants and retailers;
-- src:2786 | (C) an examination of current usage of cash benefits for the purchase of non-food and other prohibited items;
-- src:2787 | (D) an identification and assessment of potential adverse effects of the discontinuation of a portion of benefits in the form of cash for program participants and retailers; and
-- src:2788 | (E) an examination of such other factors as the Secretary determines to be relevant.
@ref s 2028(e)(1) review (src:2782-2788)
GIVEN `examines the history of and purpose for distributing a portion of monthly benefits in cash` IS A BOOLEAN
      `examines current barriers to redemption of non-cash benefits` IS A BOOLEAN
      `examines current usage of cash benefits for non-food and other prohibited items` IS A BOOLEAN
      `identifies and assesses potential adverse effects of discontinuing cash benefits` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2028(e)(1) the review includes the required examinations` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `examines the history of and purpose for distributing a portion of monthly benefits in cash`
            AND `examines current barriers to redemption of non-cash benefits`
            AND `examines current usage of cash benefits for non-food and other prohibited items`
            AND `identifies and assesses potential adverse effects of discontinuing cash benefits`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "shall carry out a review of the provision of nutrition assistance in Puerto Rico in the form of cash benefits under this section that shall include"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

-- src:2790 | Not later than 18 months after February 7, 2014, the Secretary shall submit to the Committee on Agriculture of the House of Representatives and the Committee on Agriculture, Nutrition, and Forestry of the Senate, a report that describes the results of the review conducted under this subsection.
@ref s 2028(e)(2) report within 18 months (src:2790)
GIVETH A DATE
`s 2028(e)(2) the last day for the report` MEANS
    `add months` (Date 7 2 2014) 18

@ref s 2028(e)(2) report (src:2790)
GIVEN `date the report is submitted` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2028(e)(2) the report is in time` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `date the report is submitted` AT MOST `s 2028(e)(2) the last day for the report` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Not later than 18 months after February 7, 2014"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

-- UNIT: the cash share is a FRACTION, not the percent printed in the text: 20 percent is 0.20, 5 percent is 0.05, "any portion" in fiscal year 2021 is 0.
-- src:2793 | Except as provided in subparagraph (B), and notwithstanding the second sentence of subsection (b)(1)(B)(i), the Secretary shall disapprove any plan submitted pursuant to subsection (b)(1)(A)—
-- src:2794 | (i) for fiscal year 2017 that provides for the distribution of more than 20 percent of the nutrition assistance benefit of a participant in the form of cash;
-- src:2795 | (ii) for fiscal year 2018 that provides for the distribution of more than 15 percent of the nutrition assistance benefit of a participant in the form of cash;
-- src:2796 | (iii) for fiscal year 2019 that provides for the distribution of more than 10 percent of the nutrition assistance benefit of a participant in the form of cash;
-- src:2797 | (iv) for fiscal year 2020 that provides for the distribution of more than 5 percent of the nutrition assistance benefit of a participant in the form of cash; and
-- src:2798 | (v) for fiscal year 2021 that provides for the distribution of any portion of the nutrition assistance benefit of a participant in the form of cash.
@ref s 2028(e)(3)(A) cash caps by fiscal year (src:2793-2798)
GIVEN `fiscal year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 2028(e)(3)(A) the largest share of a participant's benefit a plan may distribute in cash` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `fiscal year` EQUALS 2017 THEN JUST 0.20
        IF `fiscal year` EQUALS 2018 THEN JUST 0.15
        IF `fiscal year` EQUALS 2019 THEN JUST 0.10
        IF `fiscal year` EQUALS 2020 THEN JUST 0.05
        IF `fiscal year` EQUALS 2021 THEN JUST 0
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the text states a limit for each of fiscal years 2017 to 2021 and none for any other year
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

@ref s 2028(e)(3)(A) the Secretary shall disapprove any plan (src:2793-2798)
GIVEN `fiscal year` IS A NUMBER
      `share of a participant's benefit the plan distributes in cash` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2028(e)(3)(A) the Secretary shall disapprove the plan` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 2028(e)(3)(A) the largest share of a participant's benefit a plan may distribute in cash` `fiscal year`
    WHEN JUST cap THEN
        BRANCH
            IF `share of a participant's benefit the plan distributes in cash` GREATER THAN cap THEN JUST TRUE
            -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "that provides for the distribution of more than" the stated share; a plan at or under the share is not mentioned
            OTHERWISE NOTHING
    OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- src:2800 | Notwithstanding subparagraph (A), the Secretary, informed by the report required under paragraph (2), may approve a plan that exempts participants or categories of participants if the Secretary determines that discontinuation of benefits in the form of cash is likely to have significant adverse effects.
@ref s 2028(e)(3)(B) exception (src:2800)
GIVEN `the Secretary determines that discontinuation of benefits in the form of cash is likely to have significant adverse effects` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2028(e)(3)(B) the Secretary may approve a plan that exempts participants or categories of participants` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the Secretary determines that discontinuation of benefits in the form of cash is likely to have significant adverse effects`
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "if the Secretary determines that discontinuation of benefits in the form of cash is likely to have significant adverse effects"
    WHEN JUST FALSE THEN JUST FALSE
    -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): the Secretary's determination was not supplied
    OTHERWISE NOTHING

